!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Thyroid cancer and adjacent normal tissue were collected, physiological saline cleaning, liquid nitrogen quick freezing, and RNA was harvested using Trizol reagent.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA libraries were prepared for sequencing using standard Illumina protocols
!Sample_data_processing = Reads obtained from the sequencing machines includes raw reads containing adapters or low  quality bases which will affect the following assembly and analysis. Thus, to get high quality  clean reads, reads were further filtered by fastp  (version 0.18.0)
!Sample_data_processing = Short reads alignment tool Bowtie2 (version 2.2.8) was used for mapping reads to ribosome  RNA (rRNA) database. The rRNA mapped reads then will be removed. The remaining clean  reads were further used in assembly and gene abundance calculation.
!Sample_data_processing = An index of the reference genome was built, and paired-end clean reads were mapped to the  reference genome using HISAT2.2.4 with “-rna-strandness RF” and other parameters set as  a default.
!Sample_data_processing = The mapped reads of each sample were assembled by using StringTie v1.3.1 in a  reference-based approach. For each transcription region, a FPKM (fragment per kilobase of  transcript per million mapped reads) value was calculated to quantify its expression  abundance and variations, using StringTie software.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: GRCh38.release 94
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: all.genes.expression; circRNAs detailed sequence list
